  "bio": "Milena Lauers is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in stunning floral designs that are truly a feast for the eyes. Stationed in the heart of Porto, Portugal, Milena practices her artistry within the creative space of Bat Country Club, where professionalism is matched only by the impeccable beauty of her work. Clients seeking her out can expect not just a tattoo, but a piece of enduring art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Porto, Portugal"
